@official_mikimoto basically invented the modern pearl. Over a century later, MIKIMOTO is putting them on @chromeheartsofficial gothic crosses, safety pins, and golden spikes.⁠
⁠
The second chapter of the unlikely partnership swaps white gold for 22K yellow gold, with five pearl and pavé diamond-covered pieces. It’s grandma’s jewelry collection gone full biker, and naturally, it’s extremely hard to find. Available in limited numbers at select Chrome Hearts flagships and MIKIMOTO’s Ginza store.

